From: Hollow local patches
Subject: [PATCH] transparent windows via desc.alpha

With desc.alpha set, D3D11 on Windows 10+ presents a premultiplied-alpha
swapchain through DirectComposition (falling back to an opaque HWND
swapchain), and GLX prefers 32-bit ARGB visuals so X11 compositors blend
the window.

